DTSTAMP:20261128T075510Z
UID:614c38f460fb72849b06ae75c6ea@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Films\,London\,United Kingdom
DESCRIPTION:An absurdist chamber comedy\, Nicolás Pereda’s latest featu
 re centres on the behind-the-scenes staging of an interview with a middle-
 aged female noise musician\, which unfurls into a wider exploration of gen
 der\, performance and the costs of artistic independence.\nCategory: Films
 \nOriginal listing: https://www.ica.art/films
